            <note corresp="#d239-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d239-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, POL 27 VIET S. Top Secret; Immediate;
                    Exdis. Drafted by Cleland, cleared by Friedman (DOD), and approved by Unger.
                    Repeated to Vientiane, CINCPAC, COMUSMACV, Bangkok, and the Department of
                    Defense.</p>
            </note>
